//@version=6
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  HOLY TRINITY v1.0  —  the session range is the gate
//
//  Everything before this took ANY fractal, ANYWHERE, at ANY hour. That is
//  why 26-72 trades of wildly mixed character averaged into a coin: real
//  springs and meaningless breakdowns pooled together.
//
//  v1.0 gates on ONE thing:
//    killzone opens -> freeze the nearest unswept pool above and below
//    -> THAT is the range -> whichever edge gets raided INSIDE the session
//    is the manipulation -> trade the other way, target the far edge.
//
//  One range. One session. One or two setups a day. Wyckoff's missing
//  Phase A/B through the front door: a DEFINED range to spring from.
//
//  Nothing is deleted. PDH/PDL, BSL/SSL, OB, FVG, POI, ATR tags, scoreboard
//  and replay filter all remain. The pools still draw and still get struck
//  through when run — they just cannot ARM a setup unless they are this
//  session's range edge.
//
//  A DIFFERENT POPULATION, not the same coin measured again. It might be a
//  different coin. It might not be a coin. Nobody knows yet.
//
//  v0.8 on BTC 15m, n=72 (best-powered panel yet):
//    vs RW:  0.5R -1.4  1R +1.4  1.5R +0.3  2R +1.4  2.5R -0.8
//  Flat. The UNCONDITIONED entry is a coin and that question is closed.
//
//  The only question left: does any TAG condition it into something else?
//  ΔR cannot answer that — it compares a tag to its complement, and if the
//  population is a coin then a positive half only implies a negative half.
//  You need the tag measured against the COIN ITSELF, at every horizon.
//
//  So: REPLAY FILTER. Pick one tag. The replay table splits into trades WITH
//  it and trades WITHOUT it, and shows both against 1/(1+T). That is the
//  whole experiment. A tag earns a gate when its ON side beats RW by >5pp
//  at n>=200 on data that was not used to find it. Nothing else counts.
//
//  v0.7 verdict, pooled over 230 trades on 7 instruments:
//    Reach%  0.5R=66.1  1R=50.1  1.5R=41.9  2R=35.0  2.5R=28.6  3R=21.7
//    Random walk 1/(1+T) = 66.7  50.0  40.0  33.3  28.6  25.0
//  Six horizons, every one within ~2pp of a coin. The entry as specified
//  carries no directional information. So v0.8 does three things:
//
//  1. THE BENCHMARK IS ON THE TABLE. "vs RW" column. Nothing gets a vote
//     until it beats 1/(1+T). Should have been there from v0.5.
//  2. TWO NEW AXES. Every tag so far was derived from the OHLC geometry of
//     the same leg — nine views of one object, so of course they all said
//     the same nothing. Range context (Wyckoff Phase A/B: was there a range
//     to spring FROM) and grab sequence (is this the judas or the fifth raid
//     of the day) are sampled from outside that leg.
//  3. TWO BROKEN MEASUREMENTS FIXED. Median warm-up 20 -> 8 (at n=26 on gold
//     it left four rows reading 6/0). Bias no longer needs HH+HL on daily
//     pivots, which fired on 8% of trades; it now always has a direction.
//
//  v0.7 header retained below — the reasoning still stands.
//  ---------------------------------------------------------------------
//
//  v0.6 said EDGE +8 while the money said 0.00R across 308 trades.
//  Three things caused that. All three are fixed here.
//
//  1. TIMEOUTS WERE COUNTED AS WINS. A +0.04R scrape at maxHold logged as a
//     win identical to a 2R target. Win% inflated, EDGE inherited it.
//     Now: three outcomes. TARGET / STOP / TIMEOUT. Win% and BE% are
//     computed over RESOLVED trades only. AvgR is over all of them.
//
//  2. THE TARGET WAS FICTION. 9 of 10 instruments delivered 25-55% less
//     than the advertised RR. So the exit is no longer assumed: every trade
//     logs MFE-before-stop, and the replay table below prices EVERY target
//     from 0.5R to 3R off one run. Your own note said take the small
//     liquidity first. This is where that gets settled.
//
//  3. THE GATES HAD MAGIC NUMBERS. wickMin 0.30 and momAtr 0.60 were as
//     unjustified as OTE, and flipping the wick fix moved v0.5's +70R to
//     v0.6's 0R. So they are OFF by default and measured as tags instead.
//
//  MEDIAN TAGS: wick, displacement, coil and pool age split on the running
//  median of the last 300 trades. A tag that fires 5% or 95% of the time
//  (v0.6's coil and SMR) can never be tested. These split 50/50 by
//  construction, so the row is always readable.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

indicator("Holy Trinity v1.0 — Session Range", "HT10", overlay = true, max_boxes_count = 500, max_lines_count = 500, max_labels_count = 500, max_bars_back = 500)

// ───────────────────────────── GATES ─────────────────────────────────────
gG = "① GATES — grab · MSS · FVG. Nothing else may veto."
swLen        = input.int(5, "Pool fractal N", minval = 2, maxval = 10, group = gG)
intLen       = input.int(2, "Protected-swing fractal N", minval = 1, maxval = 10, group = gG)
sweepWin     = input.int(3, "Grab: close back inside within N bars", minval = 1, group = gG)
wickMin      = input.float(0.0, "Grab: min wick (× ATR)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.05, group = gG, tooltip = "OFF by default. This is now measured as a tag, not assumed as a gate.")
bosUseClose  = input.bool(true, "MSS requires CLOSE through level", group = gG)
momAtr       = input.float(0.0, "MSS: min body (× ATR)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.05, group = gG, tooltip = "OFF by default. Measured as a tag.")
maxBarsToBos = input.int(20, "Max bars grab -> MSS", minval = 1, group = gG)
ctxBars      = input.int(40, "Range context lookback (bars before the grab)", minval = 10, group = gG, tooltip = "Wyckoff: a spring only means something at the end of a range. This measures whether there WAS one.")
kzGate       = input.bool(true, "GATE: only raids of the session range", group = gG, tooltip = "THE v1.0 change. Off = v0.9 behaviour (any pool, any hour).")
rangeMode    = input.string("Freeze at session open", "Session range", options = ["Freeze at session open", "Develop with session"], group = gG)
oneRaid      = input.bool(true, "One raid per side per session", group = gG)

// ───────────────────────────── ENTRY / EXIT ──────────────────────────────
gE = "② ENTRY / EXIT"
retestMode      = input.string("Edge", "Retest depth", options = ["Edge", "50%", "Full fill"], group = gE)
maxBarsToRetest = input.int(30, "Max bars MSS -> retest", minval = 1, group = gE)
stopMode        = input.string("Sweep extreme", "Stop", options = ["Sweep extreme", "FVG far side"], group = gE)
targetMode      = input.string("Session range edge", "Target (the one being questioned)", options = ["Session range edge", "Opposing liquidity", "Fixed R"], group = gE)
fixedR          = input.float(2.5, "Fixed target R", minval = 0.1, step = 0.5, group = gE)
maxHold         = input.int(200, "Max bars in trade (timeout)", minval = 10, group = gE)
mfeWin          = input.int(100, "Exit replay horizon (bars)", minval = 20, group = gE, tooltip = "How long a trade is followed for the replay table. Independent of the live trade.")
costPts         = input.float(0.0, "Cost per trade (price units)", minval = 0, step = 0.01, group = gE, tooltip = "XAU ~0.32 · XAG ~0.02 · EURUSD ~0.00002 · GBPUSD ~0.00019 · USDJPY ~0.003 · WTI ~0.03. Zero is fiction.")

// ──────────────────────── TAGS — recorded, never enforced ────────────────
gT = "③ TAGS"
tzS      = input.string("Europe/London", "Timezone", options = ["Europe/London", "Europe/Helsinki", "America/New_York", "UTC"], group = gT)
nySess   = input.session("1230-1500", "NY killzone (in tz above)", group = gT, tooltip = "Default = 08:30-11:00 New York expressed in London time.")
lonSess  = input.session("0700-1000", "London killzone", group = gT)
asiaSess = input.session("0000-0600", "Asia / consolidation range", group = gT)
biasTF   = input.timeframe("D", "Bias timeframe", group = gT)
dPiv     = input.int(2, "Bias swing fractal N", minval = 1, group = gT)
eqTol    = input.float(0.10, "Equal H/L tolerance (× ATR)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.05, group = gT)
consBars = input.int(4, "Coil lookback before the FVG (bars)", minval = 2, group = gT)
maxLiq   = input.int(8, "Live pools per side", minval = 3, maxval = 20, group = gT)
warmN    = input.int(8, "Median tag warm-up (trades)", minval = 4, group = gT, tooltip = "Trades before a median tag can fire. v0.7 used 20 and starved every row at n=26.")

// ──────────────────────────── SCOREBOARD ─────────────────────────────────
gS = "④ SCOREBOARD"
showScore  = input.bool(true, "Scoreboard", group = gS)
showReplay = input.bool(true, "Exit replay table", group = gS)
showHours  = input.bool(false, "Hour table", group = gS)
minN       = input.int(30, "Min resolved n per side to colour a row", minval = 5, group = gS)
minAll     = input.int(200, "Min resolved n before the verdict is real", minval = 20, group = gS)
rpFilter   = input.string("none", "REPLAY FILTER — the experiment", options = ["none", "Stacked IMB", "Big displacement", "Old liquidity", "In killzone", "With the draw", "Right P/D", "Valid OB", "Big wick", "Tight coil", "OTE .62-.79", "Range before grab", "First grab of day", "Wide range"], group = gS, tooltip = "Splits the replay table into trades WITH this tag and WITHOUT it, each measured against the random walk 1/(1+T). This is the whole experiment.")

// ───────────────────────────── DISPLAY ───────────────────────────────────
gV = "⑤ DISPLAY"
drawPools  = input.bool(true, "Liquidity pools + labels", group = gV)
drawKZ     = input.bool(true, "Killzone boxes", group = gV)
drawDay    = input.bool(true, "Day dividers", group = gV)
drawBias   = input.bool(true, "Daily equilibrium line", group = gV)
drawSetup  = input.bool(true, "MSS · POI · OB · void", group = gV)
drawTrades = input.bool(true, "Trades: entry, outcome, R", group = gV)
drawStub   = input.bool(true, "Swept-level stub", group = gV)

// ═══════════════════════════ PRIMITIVES ══════════════════════════════════
var int firstTime = na
if barstate.isfirst
    firstTime := time

atrV  = ta.atr(14)
bodyV = math.abs(close - open)
disp  = bodyV >= momAtr * atrV
ready = bar_index >= math.max(swLen, intLen) * 2 + 3

inNY   = not na(time(timeframe.period, nySess, tzS))
inLON  = not na(time(timeframe.period, lonSess, tzS))
inASIA = not na(time(timeframe.period, asiaSess, tzS))
inKZ   = inNY or inLON     // v0.7 dropped this when the killzone stopped being a gate. v1.0 needs it back.
newDay = timeframe.change("D")
asiaStart = inASIA and not inASIA[1]
asiaEnd   = not inASIA and inASIA[1]

cRed  = color.new(#ef5350, 0)
cGrn  = color.new(#26a69a, 0)
cPurp = color.new(#ab47bc, 0)

f_upFrac(n) =>
    ok = ready
    if ok
        for i = 1 to n
            if high[n] <= high[n + i] or high[n] <= high[n - i]
                ok := false
                break
    ok

f_dnFrac(n) =>
    ok = ready
    if ok
        for i = 1 to n
            if low[n] >= low[n + i] or low[n] >= low[n - i]
                ok := false
                break
    ok

poolUp = f_upFrac(swLen)
poolDn = f_dnFrac(swLen)
intUp  = f_upFrac(intLen)
intDn  = f_dnFrac(intLen)

var float lastIntHi = na
var float lastIntLo = na
if intUp
    lastIntHi := high[intLen]
if intDn
    lastIntLo := low[intLen]

// ═══════════════════════ LIQUIDITY POOLS ═════════════════════════════════
// type: 0 swing · 1 equal H/L · 2 asia · 3 prev day
var array<float> hiPx = array.new<float>()
var array<int>   hiTy = array.new<int>()
var array<int>   hiBr = array.new<int>()
var array<line>  hiLn = array.new<line>()
var array<label> hiLb = array.new<label>()
var array<float> loPx = array.new<float>()
var array<int>   loTy = array.new<int>()
var array<int>   loBr = array.new<int>()
var array<line>  loLn = array.new<line>()
var array<label> loLb = array.new<label>()

f_addHi(px, b, ty, txt) =>
    ln = drawPools ? line.new(b, px, bar_index, px, color = color.new(cRed, 45), style = line.style_dotted) : na
    lb = drawPools ? label.new(bar_index, px, txt, style = label.style_none, textcolor = color.new(cRed, 25), size = size.tiny) : na
    array.push(hiPx, px)
    array.push(hiTy, ty)
    array.push(hiBr, b)
    array.push(hiLn, ln)
    array.push(hiLb, lb)
    if array.size(hiPx) > maxLiq
        line.delete(array.shift(hiLn))
        label.delete(array.shift(hiLb))
        array.shift(hiPx)
        array.shift(hiTy)
        array.shift(hiBr)

f_addLo(px, b, ty, txt) =>
    ln = drawPools ? line.new(b, px, bar_index, px, color = color.new(cGrn, 45), style = line.style_dotted) : na
    lb = drawPools ? label.new(bar_index, px, txt, style = label.style_none, textcolor = color.new(cGrn, 25), size = size.tiny) : na
    array.push(loPx, px)
    array.push(loTy, ty)
    array.push(loBr, b)
    array.push(loLn, ln)
    array.push(loLb, lb)
    if array.size(loPx) > maxLiq
        line.delete(array.shift(loLn))
        label.delete(array.shift(loLb))
        array.shift(loPx)
        array.shift(loTy)
        array.shift(loBr)

var float lastPoolHi = na
var float lastPoolLo = na
if poolUp
    px = high[swLen]
    eqh = not na(lastPoolHi) and math.abs(px - lastPoolHi) <= eqTol * atrV
    f_addHi(px, bar_index - swLen, eqh ? 1 : 0, eqh ? "EQH" : "BSL")
    lastPoolHi := px
if poolDn
    px = low[swLen]
    eql = not na(lastPoolLo) and math.abs(px - lastPoolLo) <= eqTol * atrV
    f_addLo(px, bar_index - swLen, eql ? 1 : 0, eql ? "EQL" : "SSL")
    lastPoolLo := px

[pdh, pdl] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "D", [high[1], low[1]], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
if timeframe.isintraday and newDay and not na(pdh)
    f_addHi(pdh, bar_index, 3, "PDH")
    f_addLo(pdl, bar_index, 3, "PDL")

var float asiaHi = na
var float asiaLo = na
if inASIA
    asiaHi := asiaStart ? high : math.max(asiaHi, high)
    asiaLo := asiaStart ? low : math.min(asiaLo, low)
if timeframe.isintraday and asiaEnd and not na(asiaHi)
    f_addHi(asiaHi, bar_index, 2, "ASIA H")
    f_addLo(asiaLo, bar_index, 2, "ASIA L")

// ═══════════════════ SESSION RANGE — THE GATE ════════════════════════════
f_nearHi(ref) =>
    float bp = na
    int bb = na
    int bt = -1
    if array.size(hiPx) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(hiPx) - 1
            p = array.get(hiPx, i)
            if p > ref and (na(bp) or p < bp)
                bp := p
                bb := array.get(hiBr, i)
                bt := array.get(hiTy, i)
    [bp, bb, bt]

f_nearLo(ref) =>
    float bp = na
    int bb = na
    int bt = -1
    if array.size(loPx) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(loPx) - 1
            p = array.get(loPx, i)
            if p < ref and (na(bp) or p > bp)
                bp := p
                bb := array.get(loBr, i)
                bt := array.get(loTy, i)
    [bp, bb, bt]

kzStart = (inNY and not inNY[1]) or (inLON and not inLON[1])

var float kzHi = na
var float kzLo = na
var int   kzHiBar = na
var int   kzLoBar = na
var int   kzHiTy = -1
var int   kzLoTy = -1
var bool  kzUsedUp = false
var bool  kzUsedDn = false
var box   kzBox = na

if kzStart
    [hp, hb, hty] = f_nearHi(close)
    [lp, lb, lty] = f_nearLo(close)
    kzHi := hp
    kzLo := lp
    kzHiBar := hb
    kzLoBar := lb
    kzHiTy := hty
    kzLoTy := lty
    kzUsedUp := false
    kzUsedDn := false
    if drawKZ and not na(hp) and not na(lp)
        kzBox := box.new(bar_index, hp, bar_index + 1, lp, border_color = color.new(color.yellow, 30), border_width = 2, bgcolor = color.new(color.yellow, 96), text = "SESSION RANGE", text_color = color.new(color.yellow, 30), text_size = size.tiny, text_halign = text.align_right, text_valign = text.align_bottom)

if inKZ and rangeMode == "Develop with session" and not kzStart
    if not kzUsedUp
        [hp2, hb2, hty2] = f_nearHi(close)
        if not na(hp2)
            kzHi := hp2
            kzHiBar := hb2
            kzHiTy := hty2
    if not kzUsedDn
        [lp2, lb2, lty2] = f_nearLo(close)
        if not na(lp2)
            kzLo := lp2
            kzLoBar := lb2
            kzLoTy := lty2

if inKZ and not na(kzBox)
    box.set_right(kzBox, bar_index + 1)
    if rangeMode == "Develop with session"
        box.set_top(kzBox, nz(kzHi, box.get_top(kzBox)))
        box.set_bottom(kzBox, nz(kzLo, box.get_bottom(kzBox)))

// ─── sweep engine ───
grabUp = false
grabDn = false
float grabUpPx = na
float grabDnPx = na
int grabUpTy = -1
int grabDnTy = -1
int grabUpAge = 0
int grabDnAge = 0

if array.size(hiPx) > 0
    for i = array.size(hiPx) - 1 to 0
        px = array.get(hiPx, i)
        ty = array.get(hiTy, i)
        ln = array.get(hiLn, i)
        if not na(ln)
            line.set_x2(ln, bar_index + 2)
        if high > px
            grabUp := true
            if ty > grabUpTy
                grabUpTy := ty
                grabUpPx := px
                grabUpAge := bar_index - array.get(hiBr, i)
            if not na(ln)
                line.set_style(ln, line.style_solid)
                line.set_color(ln, color.new(cRed, 65))
            lb = array.get(hiLb, i)
            if not na(lb)
                label.set_text(lb, "✕" + label.get_text(lb))
                label.set_x(lb, bar_index)
            array.remove(hiPx, i)
            array.remove(hiTy, i)
            array.remove(hiBr, i)
            array.remove(hiLn, i)
            array.remove(hiLb, i)

if array.size(loPx) > 0
    for i = array.size(loPx) - 1 to 0
        px = array.get(loPx, i)
        ty = array.get(loTy, i)
        ln = array.get(loLn, i)
        if not na(ln)
            line.set_x2(ln, bar_index + 2)
        if low < px
            grabDn := true
            if ty > grabDnTy
                grabDnTy := ty
                grabDnPx := px
                grabDnAge := bar_index - array.get(loBr, i)
            if not na(ln)
                line.set_style(ln, line.style_solid)
                line.set_color(ln, color.new(cGrn, 65))
            lb = array.get(loLb, i)
            if not na(lb)
                label.set_text(lb, "✕" + label.get_text(lb))
                label.set_x(lb, bar_index)
            array.remove(loPx, i)
            array.remove(loTy, i)
            array.remove(loBr, i)
            array.remove(loLn, i)
            array.remove(loLb, i)

// ═══ THE GATE ═══ pools above still draw and still get struck through; they
// simply cannot ARM anything unless they are this session's range edge.
rngW = not na(kzHi) and not na(kzLo) and atrV > 0 ? (kzHi - kzLo) / atrV : na
if kzGate
    gU = not na(kzHi) and inKZ and high > kzHi and not (oneRaid and kzUsedUp)
    gD = not na(kzLo) and inKZ and low < kzLo and not (oneRaid and kzUsedDn)
    if gU
        kzUsedUp := true
    if gD
        kzUsedDn := true
    grabUp := gU
    grabDn := gD
    grabUpPx := gU ? kzHi : na
    grabDnPx := gD ? kzLo : na
    grabUpTy := gU ? kzHiTy : -1
    grabDnTy := gD ? kzLoTy : -1
    grabUpAge := gU and not na(kzHiBar) ? bar_index - kzHiBar : 0
    grabDnAge := gD and not na(kzLoBar) ? bar_index - kzLoBar : 0

// ═══════════════════ DAILY BIAS / PREMIUM-DISCOUNT ═══════════════════════
f_htf() =>
    var float a1 = na
    var float a2 = na
    var float b1 = na
    var float b2 = na
    h = ta.pivothigh(dPiv, dPiv)
    l = ta.pivotlow(dPiv, dPiv)
    if not na(h)
        a2 := a1
        a1 := h
    if not na(l)
        b2 := b1
        b1 := l
    [a1, a2, b1, b2]

[H1, H2, L1, L2] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, biasTF, f_htf(), lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_off)
strBull = not na(H2) and not na(L2) and H1 > H2 and L1 > L2
strBear = not na(H2) and not na(L2) and H1 < H2 and L1 < L2
eqD  = (math.max(nz(H1, high), nz(H2, high)) + math.min(nz(L1, low), nz(L2, low))) / 2
prem = close > eqD
// v0.7 required HH+HL to call a bias, so "with the draw" fired on 8% of trades
// and the row was unreadable. Structure decides when it speaks; otherwise the
// dealing range does. Every trade now gets a direction, so the split is ~50/50.
biasBull = strBull or (not strBear and not prem)
biasBear = not biasBull
plot(drawBias ? eqD : na, "Daily equilibrium", color.new(color.gray, 50), 1, plot.style_linebr)

// ═══════════════════════ NEW AXES ═══════════════════════════════════════
// Efficiency ratio over ctxBars. Low = price went nowhere = a range existed
// = something to spring from. High = trend = the "grab" was just a breakdown.
erNum = math.abs(close - close[ctxBars])
erDen = math.sum(math.abs(close - close[1]), ctxBars)
erV   = erDen > 0 ? erNum / erDen : na

// Which raid of the day is this? ICT's judas is the FIRST manipulation.
// We have been taking all of them and averaging them together.
var int grabSeq = 0
if newDay
    grabSeq := 0
if grabUp or grabDn
    grabSeq += 1

// ═══════════════════════ MEDIAN TAGS ═════════════════════════════════════
// Returns -1 unknown · 0 below median · 1 at/above median. Always ~50/50.
var array<float> mWick = array.new<float>()
var array<float> mBody = array.new<float>()
var array<float> mCoil = array.new<float>()
var array<float> mAge  = array.new<float>()
var array<float> mER   = array.new<float>()
var array<float> mRngW = array.new<float>()

f_medTag(arr, v) =>
    int t = -1
    if array.size(arr) >= warmN and not na(v)
        t := v >= array.median(arr) ? 1 : 0
    if not na(v)
        array.push(arr, v)
        if array.size(arr) > 300
            array.shift(arr)
    t

f_coilRatio(j) =>
    hh = high[j + 3]
    ll = low[j + 3]
    for k = 1 to consBars - 1
        hh := math.max(hh, high[j + 3 + k])
        ll := math.min(ll, low[j + 3 + k])
    (hh - ll) / atrV

f_kzTag() =>
    inNY ? 0 : inLON ? 1 : inASIA ? 2 : 3

// ═══════════════════════ SCOREBOARD STORAGE ══════════════════════════════
//  0 ALL | 1/2 KZ | 3/4 bias | 5/6 P/D | 7/8 OB | 9/10 wick | 11/12 body
//  13/14 coil | 15/16 void | 17/18 pool age | 19/20 OTE
//  21/22 range context | 23/24 first grab of day | 25/26 wide range | 27-50 hour
var array<int>   cNa = array.new_int(51, 0)     // every trade
var array<int>   cNr = array.new_int(51, 0)     // resolved only (target or stop)
var array<int>   cW  = array.new_int(51, 0)
var array<float> cR  = array.new_float(51, 0.0)
var array<float> cRR = array.new_float(51, 0.0)
var int nTimeout = 0                            // incremented at the call sites, never inside f_log (CE10088)
var array<int> cTo = array.new_int(1, 0)      // timeout counter (array: globals cannot be assigned inside a function)

f_cell(id, r, win, rr, res) =>
    if id >= 0 and id < 51
        array.set(cNa, id, array.get(cNa, id) + 1)
        array.set(cR, id, array.get(cR, id) + r)
        if res
            array.set(cNr, id, array.get(cNr, id) + 1)
            array.set(cRR, id, array.get(cRR, id) + rr)
            if win
                array.set(cW, id, array.get(cW, id) + 1)

f_pair(id1, id0, t, r, win, rr, res) =>
    if t == 1
        f_cell(id1, r, win, rr, res)
    else if t == 0
        f_cell(id0, r, win, rr, res)

f_log(r, win, rr, res, kz, biasW, pdOk, obY, wkT, bdT, clT, voidY, agT, oteY, rgT, fstY, rwT, hr) =>
    f_cell(0, r, win, rr, res)
    f_cell(kz == 0 or kz == 1 ? 1 : 2, r, win, rr, res)
    f_cell(biasW ? 3 : 4, r, win, rr, res)
    f_cell(pdOk ? 5 : 6, r, win, rr, res)
    f_cell(obY ? 7 : 8, r, win, rr, res)
    f_pair(9, 10, wkT, r, win, rr, res)
    f_pair(11, 12, bdT, r, win, rr, res)
    f_pair(13, 14, clT, r, win, rr, res)
    f_cell(voidY ? 15 : 16, r, win, rr, res)
    f_pair(17, 18, agT, r, win, rr, res)
    f_cell(oteY ? 19 : 20, r, win, rr, res)
    f_pair(21, 22, rgT, r, win, rr, res)
    f_cell(fstY ? 23 : 24, r, win, rr, res)
    f_pair(25, 26, rwT, r, win, rr, res)
    if hr >= 0 and hr <= 23
        f_cell(27 + hr, r, win, rr, res)

// ═══════════════════════ EXIT REPLAY (shadow tracker) ════════════════════
//  Runs independently of the live trade. Follows every entry for mfeWin bars.
//  MFE is frozen the moment the 1R stop is hit, so "did T come before the
//  stop" is answered exactly rather than guessed from unordered MAE/MFE.
var array<int>   shDir  = array.new<int>()
var array<float> shEnt  = array.new<float>()
var array<float> shRisk = array.new<float>()
var array<int>   shLeft = array.new<int>()
var array<float> shMfe  = array.new<float>()
var array<int>   shBar  = array.new<int>()
var array<int>   shTag  = array.new<int>()

var array<float> tgts = array.from(0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0, 2.5, 3.0)

var array<int>   rN   = array.new_int(6, 0)
var array<int>   rHit = array.new_int(6, 0)
var array<float> rSum = array.new_float(6, 0.0)
var array<int>   qN   = array.new_int(6, 0)
var array<int>   qHit = array.new_int(6, 0)
var array<float> qSum = array.new_float(6, 0.0)

// 1 = trade carries the tag · 0 = does not · -1 = tag undefined, drop it
f_filt(kz, biasW, pdOk, obY, wkT, bdT, clT, voidY, agT, oteY, rgT, fstY, rwT) =>
    switch rpFilter
        "Stacked IMB"       => voidY ? 1 : 0
        "Big displacement"  => bdT
        "Old liquidity"     => agT
        "In killzone"       => kz == 0 or kz == 1 ? 1 : 0
        "With the draw"     => biasW ? 1 : 0
        "Right P/D"         => pdOk ? 1 : 0
        "Valid OB"          => obY ? 1 : 0
        "Big wick"          => wkT
        "Tight coil"        => clT
        "OTE .62-.79"       => oteY ? 1 : 0
        "Range before grab" => rgT
        "First grab of day" => fstY ? 1 : 0
        "Wide range"        => rwT
        => 1

f_replay(mfe, risk, stopped, endR, tagOn) =>
    cst = costPts / risk
    if tagOn >= 0
        for k = 0 to 5
            T = array.get(tgts, k)
            hit = mfe >= T
            r = hit ? T - cst : stopped ? -1.0 - cst : endR - cst
            if tagOn == 1
                array.set(rN, k, array.get(rN, k) + 1)
                array.set(rSum, k, array.get(rSum, k) + r)
                if hit
                    array.set(rHit, k, array.get(rHit, k) + 1)
            else
                array.set(qN, k, array.get(qN, k) + 1)
                array.set(qSum, k, array.get(qSum, k) + r)
                if hit
                    array.set(qHit, k, array.get(qHit, k) + 1)

// ═══════════════════════════ BEAR STATE ══════════════════════════════════
var int   beSt = 0
var float beLvl = na
var int   beTy = 0
var int   beAge = 0
var float beHi = na
var float beBody = na
var float beWickV = na
var float beProt = na
var float beRunLo = na
var float beRngHi = na
var float beRngLo = na
var float beFvgT = na
var float beFvgB = na
var float beRet = na
var float beCoilV = na
var float beBodyV = na
var float beEnt = na
var float beStp = na
var float beTgt = na
var float beRR = na
var int   beCnt = 0
var int   beBar = na
var int   beEntBar = na
var bool  beOB = false
var bool  beVoid = false
var int   beKz = 3
var int   beHr = na
var bool  beBias = false
var bool  bePD = false
var bool  beOTE = false
var int   beWkT = -1
var int   beBdT = -1
var int   beClT = -1
var int   beAgT = -1
var int   beRgT = -1
var float beEdge = na
var float beRngW = na
var int   beRwT = -1
var float beER = na
var int   beSeq = 0
var int   beNF = 0
var bool  beFst = false

if beSt == 0
    if grabUp and not na(lastIntLo)
        beSt := 1
        beLvl := grabUpPx
        beTy := grabUpTy
        beAge := grabUpAge
        beHi := high
        beBody := math.max(open, close)
        beER := erV[1]
        beEdge := kzLo
        beRngW := rngW
        beSeq := grabSeq
        beCnt := 0
        if drawStub
            line.new(bar_index, grabUpPx, bar_index + 3, grabUpPx, color = color.new(cRed, 20), width = 2)

else if beSt == 1
    if high > beHi
        beHi := high
        beBody := math.max(open, close)
    beCnt += 1
    if close < beLvl
        wick = beHi - beBody
        if wick < wickMin * atrV
            beSt := 0
        else
            beWickV := wick / atrV
            beProt := lastIntLo
            beRunLo := low
            beBar := bar_index
            beCnt := 0
            beSt := na(beProt) ? 0 : 2
    else if beCnt > sweepWin
        beSt := 0

else if beSt == 2
    beRunLo := math.min(beRunLo, low)
    beCnt += 1
    bosHit = bosUseClose ? close < beProt : low < beProt
    if bosHit and disp
        beBodyV := bodyV / atrV
        beRngHi := beHi
        beRngLo := beRunLo
        rng = beRngHi - beRngLo
        legLen = math.min(bar_index - beBar + 2, 60)
        float bT = na
        float bB = na
        float bD = na
        float bC = na
        int nF = 0
        if rng > 0
            for j = 0 to legLen
                t = low[j + 2]
                b = high[j]
                if t > b
                    nF += 1
                    m = (t + b) / 2
                    d = (m - beRngLo) / rng
                    if d <= 1.0 and (na(bD) or d > bD)
                        bT := t
                        bB := b
                        bD := d
                        bC := f_coilRatio(j)
        beFvgT := bT
        beFvgB := bB
        beRet := bD
        beCoilV := bC
        beNF := nF
        beVoid := nF > 1
        bool obFound = false
        for j = 1 to legLen
            if close[j] > open[j] and close[j - 1] < open[j - 1] and close[j - 1] < open[j] and math.abs(close[j - 1] - open[j - 1]) >= 0.6 * atrV
                obFound := true
                if drawSetup
                    box.new(bar_index - j, high[j], bar_index + 12, low[j], border_color = color.new(cRed, 45), bgcolor = color.new(cRed, 90), text = "OB", text_size = size.tiny, text_color = color.new(cRed, 25))
                break
        beOB := obFound
        if na(bT)
            beSt := 0
        else
            beCnt := 0
            beSt := 3
            if drawSetup
                box.new(bar_index - 2, bT, bar_index + 12, bB, border_color = color.new(cRed, 50), bgcolor = color.new(cRed, 88), text = "POI", text_size = size.tiny, text_color = color.new(cRed, 30))
                label.new(bar_index, low, "MSS", style = label.style_label_up, color = color.new(cRed, 40), textcolor = color.white, size = size.tiny)
                if beVoid
                    box.new(beBar, beRngHi, bar_index + 12, beRngLo, border_color = color.new(cPurp, 70), border_style = line.style_dashed, bgcolor = color.new(cPurp, 95), text = str.tostring(nF) + "× IMB", text_size = size.tiny, text_color = color.new(cPurp, 40), text_halign = text.align_left, text_valign = text.align_top)
    else if beCnt > maxBarsToBos
        beSt := 0

else if beSt == 3
    beCnt += 1
    lvl = switch retestMode
        "Edge" => beFvgB
        "50%"  => (beFvgT + beFvgB) / 2
        => beFvgT
    if high >= lvl
        e = lvl
        s = stopMode == "Sweep extreme" ? beRngHi : beFvgT
        g = targetMode == "Session range edge" and not na(beEdge) ? beEdge : targetMode == "Opposing liquidity" ? beRngLo : e - fixedR * (s - e)
        if s > e and e > g
            beEnt := e
            beStp := s
            beTgt := g
            beRR := (e - g) / (s - e)
            beKz := f_kzTag()
            beHr := hour(time, tzS)
            beBias := biasBear
            bePD := prem
            beOTE := beRet >= 0.62 and beRet < 0.79
            beWkT := f_medTag(mWick, beWickV)
            beBdT := f_medTag(mBody, beBodyV)
            ct = f_medTag(mCoil, beCoilV)
            beClT := ct == 1 ? 0 : ct == 0 ? 1 : -1        // tight coil = BELOW median
            beAgT := f_medTag(mAge, beAge * 1.0)
            rt = f_medTag(mER, beER)
            beRgT := rt == 1 ? 0 : rt == 0 ? 1 : -1        // ranging = ER BELOW median
            beFst := beSeq <= 1
            beRwT := f_medTag(mRngW, beRngW)
            beEntBar := bar_index
            beCnt := 0
            beSt := 4
            array.push(shDir, -1)
            array.push(shEnt, e)
            array.push(shRisk, s - e)
            array.push(shLeft, mfeWin)
            array.push(shMfe, 0.0)
            array.push(shBar, bar_index)
            array.push(shTag, f_filt(beKz, beBias, bePD, beOB, beWkT, beBdT, beClT, beVoid, beAgT, beOTE, beRgT, beFst, beRwT))
            if drawTrades
                label.new(bar_index, e, "S " + str.tostring(beRet, "#.##") + " | " + str.tostring(beRR, "#.#") + "R", style = label.style_label_down, color = color.new(color.maroon, 20), textcolor = color.white, size = size.tiny)
        else
            beSt := 0
    else if beCnt > maxBarsToRetest
        beSt := 0

else if beSt == 4
    beCnt += 1
    risk = beStp - beEnt
    if high >= beStp
        r = -1.0 - costPts / risk
        f_log(r, false, beRR, true, beKz, beBias, bePD, beOB, beWkT, beBdT, beClT, beVoid, beAgT, beOTE, beRgT, beFst, beRwT, beHr)
        if drawTrades
            box.new(beEntBar, beStp, bar_index, beEnt, border_color = color.new(cRed, 60), bgcolor = color.new(cRed, 85))
            label.new(bar_index, beStp, str.tostring(r, "#.#") + "R", style = label.style_none, textcolor = cRed, size = size.tiny)
        beSt := 0
    else if low <= beTgt
        r = (beEnt - beTgt) / risk - costPts / risk
        f_log(r, true, beRR, true, beKz, beBias, bePD, beOB, beWkT, beBdT, beClT, beVoid, beAgT, beOTE, beRgT, beFst, beRwT, beHr)
        if drawTrades
            box.new(beEntBar, beEnt, bar_index, beTgt, border_color = color.new(cGrn, 60), bgcolor = color.new(cGrn, 85))
            label.new(bar_index, beTgt, "+" + str.tostring(r, "#.#") + "R", style = label.style_none, textcolor = cGrn, size = size.tiny)
        beSt := 0
    else if beCnt > maxHold
        r = (beEnt - close) / risk - costPts / risk
        f_log(r, false, beRR, false, beKz, beBias, bePD, beOB, beWkT, beBdT, beClT, beVoid, beAgT, beOTE, beRgT, beFst, beRwT, beHr)
        nTimeout += 1
        if drawTrades
            label.new(bar_index, close, "t " + str.tostring(r, "#.#") + "R", style = label.style_none, textcolor = color.gray, size = size.tiny)
        beSt := 0

// ═══════════════════════════ BULL STATE ══════════════════════════════════
var int   buSt = 0
var float buLvl = na
var int   buTy = 0
var int   buAge = 0
var float buLo = na
var float buBody = na
var float buWickV = na
var float buProt = na
var float buRunHi = na
var float buRngHi = na
var float buRngLo = na
var float buFvgT = na
var float buFvgB = na
var float buRet = na
var float buCoilV = na
var float buBodyV = na
var float buEnt = na
var float buStp = na
var float buTgt = na
var float buRR = na
var int   buCnt = 0
var int   buBar = na
var int   buEntBar = na
var bool  buOB = false
var bool  buVoid = false
var int   buKz = 3
var int   buHr = na
var bool  buBias = false
var bool  buPD = false
var bool  buOTE = false
var int   buWkT = -1
var int   buBdT = -1
var int   buClT = -1
var int   buAgT = -1
var int   buRgT = -1
var float buEdge = na
var float buRngW = na
var int   buRwT = -1
var float buER = na
var int   buSeq = 0
var int   buNF = 0
var bool  buFst = false

if buSt == 0
    if grabDn and not na(lastIntHi)
        buSt := 1
        buLvl := grabDnPx
        buTy := grabDnTy
        buAge := grabDnAge
        buLo := low
        buBody := math.min(open, close)
        buER := erV[1]
        buEdge := kzHi
        buRngW := rngW
        buSeq := grabSeq
        buCnt := 0
        if drawStub
            line.new(bar_index, grabDnPx, bar_index + 3, grabDnPx, color = color.new(cGrn, 20), width = 2)

else if buSt == 1
    if low < buLo
        buLo := low
        buBody := math.min(open, close)
    buCnt += 1
    if close > buLvl
        wick = buBody - buLo
        if wick < wickMin * atrV
            buSt := 0
        else
            buWickV := wick / atrV
            buProt := lastIntHi
            buRunHi := high
            buBar := bar_index
            buCnt := 0
            buSt := na(buProt) ? 0 : 2
    else if buCnt > sweepWin
        buSt := 0

else if buSt == 2
    buRunHi := math.max(buRunHi, high)
    buCnt += 1
    bosHit = bosUseClose ? close > buProt : high > buProt
    if bosHit and disp
        buBodyV := bodyV / atrV
        buRngLo := buLo
        buRngHi := buRunHi
        rng = buRngHi - buRngLo
        legLen = math.min(bar_index - buBar + 2, 60)
        float bT = na
        float bB = na
        float bD = na
        float bC = na
        int nF = 0
        if rng > 0
            for j = 0 to legLen
                b = high[j + 2]
                t = low[j]
                if t > b
                    nF += 1
                    m = (t + b) / 2
                    d = (buRngHi - m) / rng
                    if d <= 1.0 and (na(bD) or d > bD)
                        bT := t
                        bB := b
                        bD := d
                        bC := f_coilRatio(j)
        buFvgT := bT
        buFvgB := bB
        buRet := bD
        buCoilV := bC
        buNF := nF
        buVoid := nF > 1
        bool obFound = false
        for j = 1 to legLen
            if close[j] < open[j] and close[j - 1] > open[j - 1] and close[j - 1] > open[j] and math.abs(close[j - 1] - open[j - 1]) >= 0.6 * atrV
                obFound := true
                if drawSetup
                    box.new(bar_index - j, high[j], bar_index + 12, low[j], border_color = color.new(cGrn, 45), bgcolor = color.new(cGrn, 90), text = "OB", text_size = size.tiny, text_color = color.new(cGrn, 25))
                break
        buOB := obFound
        if na(bT)
            buSt := 0
        else
            buCnt := 0
            buSt := 3
            if drawSetup
                box.new(bar_index - 2, bT, bar_index + 12, bB, border_color = color.new(cGrn, 50), bgcolor = color.new(cGrn, 88), text = "POI", text_size = size.tiny, text_color = color.new(cGrn, 30))
                label.new(bar_index, high, "MSS", style = label.style_label_down, color = color.new(cGrn, 40), textcolor = color.white, size = size.tiny)
                if buVoid
                    box.new(buBar, buRngHi, bar_index + 12, buRngLo, border_color = color.new(cPurp, 70), border_style = line.style_dashed, bgcolor = color.new(cPurp, 95), text = str.tostring(nF) + "× IMB", text_size = size.tiny, text_color = color.new(cPurp, 40), text_halign = text.align_left, text_valign = text.align_top)
    else if buCnt > maxBarsToBos
        buSt := 0

else if buSt == 3
    buCnt += 1
    lvl = switch retestMode
        "Edge" => buFvgT
        "50%"  => (buFvgT + buFvgB) / 2
        => buFvgB
    if low <= lvl
        e = lvl
        s = stopMode == "Sweep extreme" ? buRngLo : buFvgB
        g = targetMode == "Session range edge" and not na(buEdge) ? buEdge : targetMode == "Opposing liquidity" ? buRngHi : e + fixedR * (e - s)
        if s < e and e < g
            buEnt := e
            buStp := s
            buTgt := g
            buRR := (g - e) / (e - s)
            buKz := f_kzTag()
            buHr := hour(time, tzS)
            buBias := biasBull
            buPD := not prem
            buOTE := buRet >= 0.62 and buRet < 0.79
            buWkT := f_medTag(mWick, buWickV)
            buBdT := f_medTag(mBody, buBodyV)
            ct = f_medTag(mCoil, buCoilV)
            buClT := ct == 1 ? 0 : ct == 0 ? 1 : -1
            buAgT := f_medTag(mAge, buAge * 1.0)
            rt = f_medTag(mER, buER)
            buRgT := rt == 1 ? 0 : rt == 0 ? 1 : -1        // ranging = ER BELOW median
            buFst := buSeq <= 1
            buRwT := f_medTag(mRngW, buRngW)
            buEntBar := bar_index
            buCnt := 0
            buSt := 4
            array.push(shDir, 1)
            array.push(shEnt, e)
            array.push(shRisk, e - s)
            array.push(shLeft, mfeWin)
            array.push(shMfe, 0.0)
            array.push(shBar, bar_index)
            array.push(shTag, f_filt(buKz, buBias, buPD, buOB, buWkT, buBdT, buClT, buVoid, buAgT, buOTE, buRgT, buFst, buRwT))
            if drawTrades
                label.new(bar_index, e, "L " + str.tostring(buRet, "#.##") + " | " + str.tostring(buRR, "#.#") + "R", style = label.style_label_up, color = color.new(color.green, 20), textcolor = color.white, size = size.tiny)
        else
            buSt := 0
    else if buCnt > maxBarsToRetest
        buSt := 0

else if buSt == 4
    buCnt += 1
    risk = buEnt - buStp
    if low <= buStp
        r = -1.0 - costPts / risk
        f_log(r, false, buRR, true, buKz, buBias, buPD, buOB, buWkT, buBdT, buClT, buVoid, buAgT, buOTE, buRgT, buFst, buRwT, buHr)
        if drawTrades
            box.new(buEntBar, buEnt, bar_index, buStp, border_color = color.new(cRed, 60), bgcolor = color.new(cRed, 85))
            label.new(bar_index, buStp, str.tostring(r, "#.#") + "R", style = label.style_none, textcolor = cRed, size = size.tiny)
        buSt := 0
    else if high >= buTgt
        r = (buTgt - buEnt) / risk - costPts / risk
        f_log(r, true, buRR, true, buKz, buBias, buPD, buOB, buWkT, buBdT, buClT, buVoid, buAgT, buOTE, buRgT, buFst, buRwT, buHr)
        if drawTrades
            box.new(buEntBar, buTgt, bar_index, buEnt, border_color = color.new(cGrn, 60), bgcolor = color.new(cGrn, 85))
            label.new(bar_index, buTgt, "+" + str.tostring(r, "#.#") + "R", style = label.style_none, textcolor = cGrn, size = size.tiny)
        buSt := 0
    else if buCnt > maxHold
        r = (close - buEnt) / risk - costPts / risk
        f_log(r, false, buRR, false, buKz, buBias, buPD, buOB, buWkT, buBdT, buClT, buVoid, buAgT, buOTE, buRgT, buFst, buRwT, buHr)
        nTimeout += 1
        if drawTrades
            label.new(bar_index, close, "t " + str.tostring(r, "#.#") + "R", style = label.style_none, textcolor = color.gray, size = size.tiny)
        buSt := 0

// ═══════════════════ SHADOW TRACKER — runs every bar ═════════════════════
if array.size(shDir) > 0
    for i = array.size(shDir) - 1 to 0
        if array.get(shBar, i) != bar_index
            d = array.get(shDir, i)
            e = array.get(shEnt, i)
            rk = array.get(shRisk, i)
            fav = d == -1 ? (e - low) / rk : (high - e) / rk
            adv = d == -1 ? (high - e) / rk : (e - low) / rk
            array.set(shMfe, i, math.max(array.get(shMfe, i), fav))
            if adv >= 1.0
                f_replay(array.get(shMfe, i), rk, true, -1.0, array.get(shTag, i))
                array.remove(shDir, i)
                array.remove(shEnt, i)
                array.remove(shRisk, i)
                array.remove(shLeft, i)
                array.remove(shMfe, i)
                array.remove(shBar, i)
                array.remove(shTag, i)
            else
                array.set(shLeft, i, array.get(shLeft, i) - 1)
                if array.get(shLeft, i) <= 0
                    endR = d == -1 ? (e - close) / rk : (close - e) / rk
                    f_replay(array.get(shMfe, i), rk, false, endR, array.get(shTag, i))
                    array.remove(shDir, i)
                    array.remove(shEnt, i)
                    array.remove(shRisk, i)
                    array.remove(shLeft, i)
                    array.remove(shMfe, i)
                    array.remove(shBar, i)
                    array.remove(shTag, i)

// ═══════════════════════ KILLZONE / DAY DRAWING ══════════════════════════
f_kzbox(inSess, isStart, col, txt) =>
    var box b = na
    if isStart
        b := box.new(bar_index, high, bar_index, low, border_color = color.new(col, 55), bgcolor = color.new(col, 94), text = txt, text_color = color.new(col, 40), text_size = size.tiny, text_halign = text.align_left, text_valign = text.align_top)
    if inSess and not na(b)
        box.set_right(b, bar_index + 1)
        box.set_top(b, math.max(box.get_top(b), high))
        box.set_bottom(b, math.min(box.get_bottom(b), low))
    b

nyStart  = inNY and not inNY[1]
lonStart = inLON and not inLON[1]
if drawKZ and timeframe.isintraday
    f_kzbox(inNY, nyStart, color.blue, "NY")
    f_kzbox(inLON, lonStart, color.orange, "LON")
    f_kzbox(inASIA, asiaStart, color.gray, "ASIA")

if drawDay and newDay and timeframe.isintraday
    line.new(bar_index, low, bar_index, high, extend = extend.both, color = color.new(color.gray, 75), style = line.style_dotted)

// ═══════════════════════════ SCOREBOARD ══════════════════════════════════
f_nAll(id) => array.get(cNa, id)
f_nRes(id) => array.get(cNr, id)
f_winp(id) => array.get(cNr, id) > 0 ? array.get(cW, id) * 100.0 / array.get(cNr, id) : na
f_be(id)   => array.get(cNr, id) > 0 ? 100.0 / (1.0 + array.get(cRR, id) / array.get(cNr, id)) : na
f_edge(id) => array.get(cNr, id) > 0 ? array.get(cW, id) * 100.0 / array.get(cNr, id) - 100.0 / (1.0 + array.get(cRR, id) / array.get(cNr, id)) : na
f_avgR(id) => array.get(cNa, id) > 0 ? array.get(cR, id) / array.get(cNa, id) : na

f_paint(tbl, r, c0, c1, c2, c3, c4, c5, bg, tc) =>
    table.cell(tbl, 0, r, c0, bgcolor = bg, text_color = tc, text_size = size.small, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, r, c1, bgcolor = bg, text_color = tc, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, r, c2, bgcolor = bg, text_color = tc, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, r, c3, bgcolor = bg, text_color = tc, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 4, r, c4, bgcolor = bg, text_color = tc, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 5, r, c5, bgcolor = bg, text_color = tc, text_size = size.small)

// one row = one question. A against its own complement, ranked on AvgR.
f_test(tbl, r, lbl, idA, idB) =>
    nA = f_nRes(idA)
    nB = f_nRes(idB)
    rA = f_avgR(idA)
    rB = f_avgR(idB)
    eA = f_edge(idA)
    wA = f_winp(idA)
    solid = math.min(nA, nB) >= minN
    d = not na(rA) and not na(rB) ? rA - rB : na
    bg = na(d) ? color.new(color.gray, 88) : not solid ? color.new(color.gray, 80) : d > 0 ? color.new(color.green, 55) : color.new(color.red, 55)
    tc = solid ? color.white : color.new(color.silver, 35)
    f_paint(tbl, r, lbl, str.tostring(nA) + "/" + str.tostring(nB), na(wA) ? "-" : str.tostring(wA, "#"), na(eA) ? "-" : (eA > 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(eA, "#"), na(rA) ? "-" : str.tostring(rA, "#.##"), na(d) ? "-" : (d > 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(d, "#.##"), bg, tc)

if showScore and barstate.islast
    var table sb = table.new(position.top_right, 6, 19, border_width = 1, frame_width = 1, frame_color = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    aAll = f_nAll(0)
    nAll = f_nRes(0)
    rAll = f_avgR(0)
    eAll = f_edge(0)
    wAll = f_winp(0)
    decid = nAll >= minAll
    f_paint(sb, 0, "HOLY TRINITY v1.0", "n", "Win%", "EDGE", "AvgR", "ΔR", color.navy, color.white)
    f_paint(sb, 1, "ALL TRADES", str.tostring(nAll) + "/" + str.tostring(aAll), na(wAll) ? "-" : str.tostring(wAll, "#"), na(eAll) ? "-" : (eAll > 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(eAll, "#"), na(rAll) ? "-" : str.tostring(rAll, "#.##") + "R", "", aAll == 0 ? color.new(color.gray, 80) : not decid ? color.new(color.orange, 65) : nz(rAll) > 0 ? color.new(color.green, 35) : color.new(color.red, 35), color.white)
    f_test(sb, 2,  "In killzone",      1,  2)
    f_test(sb, 3,  "With the draw",    3,  4)
    f_test(sb, 4,  "Right P/D side",   5,  6)
    f_test(sb, 5,  "Valid OB",         7,  8)
    f_test(sb, 6,  "Big wick",         9,  10)
    f_test(sb, 7,  "Big displacement", 11, 12)
    f_test(sb, 8,  "Tight coil",       13, 14)
    f_test(sb, 9,  "Stacked IMB",      15, 16)
    f_test(sb, 10, "Old liquidity",    17, 18)
    f_test(sb, 11, "OTE .62-.79",      19, 20)
    f_test(sb, 12, "Range before grab", 21, 22)
    f_test(sb, 13, "First grab of day", 23, 24)
    f_test(sb, 14, "Wide range",        25, 26)
    verdict = aAll == 0 ? "no trades yet" : not decid ? "NOT DECIDABLE — need " + str.tostring(minAll) + " resolved, have " + str.tostring(nAll) : nz(rAll) > 0 ? "EDGE " + str.tostring(rAll, "#.##") + "R/trade" : "NO EDGE (" + str.tostring(rAll, "#.##") + "R)"
    f_paint(sb, 15, verdict, "", "", "", "", "", aAll == 0 or not decid ? color.new(color.orange, 60) : nz(rAll) > 0 ? color.new(color.green, 40) : color.new(color.red, 40), color.white)
    f_paint(sb, 16, "timeouts " + str.tostring(nTimeout) + " (" + str.tostring(aAll > 0 ? nTimeout * 100.0 / aAll : 0, "#") + "%) · excluded from Win%/EDGE", "", "", "", "", "", color.new(color.gray, 55), color.silver)
    f_paint(sb, 17, "bars " + str.tostring(bar_index + 1) + " · from " + str.format_time(firstTime, "yyyy-MM-dd", tzS) + " · cost " + str.tostring(costPts), "", "", "", "", "", color.new(color.gray, 55), color.silver)
    f_paint(sb, 18, "n = resolved/all · ΔR = this minus its opposite · grey = n<" + str.tostring(minN), "", "", "", "", "", color.new(color.gray, 55), color.silver)

// CE10156: Pine only allows function declarations at the TOP level. This lived
// inside the replay table's for-loop, which is a local scope.
f_col(ex, n) =>
    na(ex) or n < minN ? color.new(color.gray, 80) : math.abs(ex) < 3 ? color.new(color.gray, 65) : ex > 0 ? color.new(color.green, 45) : color.new(color.red, 45)

if showReplay and barstate.islast
    var table rt = table.new(position.bottom_right, 6, 9, border_width = 1, frame_width = 1, frame_color = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    on = rpFilter == "none" ? "ALL" : rpFilter
    table.cell(rt, 0, 0, "EXIT REPLAY", bgcolor = color.navy, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(rt, 1, 0, "n", bgcolor = color.new(color.green, 50), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(rt, 2, 0, "vs RW", bgcolor = color.new(color.green, 50), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(rt, 3, 0, "n", bgcolor = color.new(color.red, 50), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(rt, 4, 0, "vs RW", bgcolor = color.new(color.red, 50), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(rt, 5, 0, "ΔReach", bgcolor = color.navy, text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    for k = 0 to 5
        T  = array.get(tgts, k)
        rw = 100.0 / (1.0 + T)
        n1 = array.get(rN, k)
        n0 = array.get(qN, k)
        h1 = n1 > 0 ? array.get(rHit, k) / n1 * 100 : na
        h0 = n0 > 0 ? array.get(qHit, k) / n0 * 100 : na
        e1 = na(h1) ? na : h1 - rw
        e0 = na(h0) ? na : h0 - rw
        dd = na(h1) or na(h0) ? na : h1 - h0
        table.cell(rt, 0, k + 1, "target " + str.tostring(T, "#.#") + "R", bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 70), text_color = color.silver, text_size = size.small, text_halign = text.align_left)
        table.cell(rt, 1, k + 1, str.tostring(n1), bgcolor = f_col(e1, n1), text_color = n1 < minN ? color.new(color.silver, 30) : color.white, text_size = size.small)
        table.cell(rt, 2, k + 1, na(e1) ? "-" : (e1 > 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(e1, "#.#"), bgcolor = f_col(e1, n1), text_color = n1 < minN ? color.new(color.silver, 30) : color.white, text_size = size.small)
        table.cell(rt, 3, k + 1, str.tostring(n0), bgcolor = f_col(e0, n0), text_color = n0 < minN ? color.new(color.silver, 30) : color.white, text_size = size.small)
        table.cell(rt, 4, k + 1, na(e0) ? "-" : (e0 > 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(e0, "#.#"), bgcolor = f_col(e0, n0), text_color = n0 < minN ? color.new(color.silver, 30) : color.white, text_size = size.small)
        table.cell(rt, 5, k + 1, na(dd) ? "-" : (dd > 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(dd, "#.#"), bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 70), text_color = na(dd) or math.min(n1, n0) < minN ? color.new(color.silver, 30) : dd > 0 ? color.lime : color.red, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(rt, 0, 7, "WITH: " + on, bgcolor = color.new(color.green, 55), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small, text_halign = text.align_left)
    table.cell(rt, 1, 7, "", bgcolor = color.new(color.green, 55), text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(rt, 2, 7, "", bgcolor = color.new(color.green, 55), text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(rt, 3, 7, "WITHOUT", bgcolor = color.new(color.red, 55), text_color = color.white, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(rt, 4, 7, "", bgcolor = color.new(color.red, 55), text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(rt, 5, 7, "", bgcolor = color.new(color.red, 55), text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(rt, 0, 8, "grey = coin (|vs RW| < 3pp) · gate needs >5pp at n>=200 out of sample", bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 55), text_color = color.silver, text_size = size.small, text_halign = text.align_left)
    for c = 1 to 5
        table.cell(rt, c, 8, "", bgcolor = color.new(color.gray, 55), text_size = size.small)

if showHours and barstate.islast
    var table ht = table.new(position.bottom_left, 6, 25, border_width = 1, frame_width = 1, frame_color = color.new(color.gray, 40))
    f_paint(ht, 0, "Hour " + tzS, "n", "Win%", "EDGE", "AvgR", "", color.navy, color.white)
    int rw = 1
    for h = 0 to 23
        aH = f_nAll(27 + h)
        nH = f_nRes(27 + h)
        if aH > 0 and rw <= 24
            rH = f_avgR(27 + h)
            eH = f_edge(27 + h)
            wH = f_winp(27 + h)
            bg = nH < minN ? color.new(color.gray, 80) : nz(rH) > 0 ? color.new(color.green, 55) : color.new(color.red, 55)
            f_paint(ht, rw, str.tostring(h) + ":00", str.tostring(nH) + "/" + str.tostring(aH), na(wH) ? "-" : str.tostring(wH, "#"), na(eH) ? "-" : (eH > 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(eH, "#"), na(rH) ? "-" : str.tostring(rH, "#.##"), "", bg, nH < minN ? color.new(color.silver, 35) : color.white)
            rw += 1
